WEBVTT

00:03:27.916 --> 00:03:30.436
but the environment sector
isn't reaching those people

00:03:30.476 --> 00:03:31.996
and we have to fix that.

00:03:35.356 --> 00:03:37.036
You might be asking,

00:03:37.076 --> 00:03:39.236
why do we need to change
the conversation now,

00:03:39.236 --> 00:03:41.836
when interest in the environment
has never been higher?

00:03:41.876 --> 00:03:43.196
Aren't we already winning?

00:03:43.236 --> 00:03:45.076
Yes, in some ways we are.

00:03:45.116 --> 00:03:46.556
But we have all the people

00:03:46.596 --> 00:03:48.876
who are motivated
by the plight of the polar bear

00:03:48.916 --> 00:03:50.476
and the loss of the rain forest.

00:03:50.476 --> 00:03:53.476
We have all the people
who can change their whole life around

00:03:53.476 --> 00:03:54.916
and make every decision

00:03:54.916 --> 00:03:57.156
based on how they lower
their carbon footprint.

00:03:57.196 --> 00:03:58.796
You might be one of those people,

00:03:58.796 --> 00:04:01.036
that is amazing, you are a trailblazer.